        {
          "body": "[P1] Preserve the collected selector measurements\n\nThis merge adds the selector observations to the report, but the unconditional assignments immediately below reset `selector_elapsed_ms`, `stage_elapsed_seconds`, `selector_usage`, `selector_concurrency`, and `selector_retries` to `None`. As a result, even a fully verified terminal/result/archive chain is reported as unknown and cannot supply the selector resource evidence this collector just verified.",
          "commit_id": "5a82b8d1d9c5be762e72974b345de8294ababd97",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T22:38:17Z",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/pull/747#discussion_r4235119032",
          "id": 4235119032,
          "line": 1089,
          "original_commit_id": "7c86ba27742b3384979f7068a6c247f9ad392ca4",
