            "login": "factory-droid[bot]",
            "type": "Bot"
          }
        },
        {
          "body": "[P2] Preserve verification for late phase-failure closeouts\n\nA phase failure sets the inventory to `terminal-incomplete` without setting `gate_result_authoritative` to `False`. If the final inventory fsync then completes after the deadline, the correction branch is skipped because the status is already incomplete, so the closeout contains a late elapsed time with no explicit authority flag. This check then rejects that otherwise correctly bound closeout, preventing a later consumer from verifying its timing observation.",
          "commit_id": "5a82b8d1d9c5be762e72974b345de8294ababd97",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T22:38:17Z",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/pull/747#discussion_r4235119040",
          "id": 4235119040,
          "line": 241,
          "original_commit_id": "7c86ba27742b3384979f7068a6c247f9ad392ca4",
          "original_line": 241,
          "original_start_line": null,
          "path": "scripts/coverage_resource_evidence.py",
          "pull_request_review_id": 5476009871,
          "side": "RIGHT",
          "start_line": null,
          "updated_at": "2026-10-09T22:38:17Z",
          "user": {
            "id": 138933559,
            "login": "factory-droid[bot]",
            "type": "Bot"
          }
        },
        {
          "body": "The four selector resets are removed in the current head (inherited b865c2c / upstream #746), and the full collector regression verifies archived elapsed/usage/concurrency/retries survive. Stage-wide elapsed is intentionally unknown during the earlier resource calculation: this PR records it only after final inventory fsync and exposes a separately verified closeout for later consumption. Treating that earlier None as measured time would be incorrect. The separate late phase-failure authority finding is being fixed.",
          "commit_id": "5a82b8d1d9c5be762e72974b345de8294ababd97",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T22:41:50Z",
          "html_url": "https://github.com/magnus919/SlopSearX/pull/747#discussion_r4235146507",
          "id": 4235146507,
          "line": 1089,
          "original_commit_id": "7c86ba27742b3384979f7068a6c247f9ad392ca4",
          "original_line": 1089,
