            "type": "User"
          }
        },
        {
          "body": "Fixed in 5a82b8d1d9c5be762e72974b345de8294ababd97. New inventories explicitly start with gate_result_authoritative=false; only validated gates set it true. The new full coordinator regression combines acquisition failure with late final fsync, independently verifies the closeout pins/timing, and preserves acquisition-failed with authority false. The verifier remains strict. Complete coverage suite: 204 passed and 3 subtests.",
          "commit_id": "5a82b8d1d9c5be762e72974b345de8294ababd97",
          "created_at": "2026-10-09T22:43:22Z",
